          "type": "text",
          "text": "Virgil Finlay (1914-1971), ''Fantastic'', Vol. 2, #2, 1953\n\nIllustration for the story 'Root of Evil' by Shirley Jackson. I think Virgil captures what it feels like to live in late-stage capitalism with its constant and ubiquitous rent seeking. ",
